    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy feels like a joke. how do you \"treat\" the fact that the spark is just... gone? it's not just being tired. it's like the light went out and i'm just sitting here in the dark. there's no \"rediscovering\" anything when there's nothing left to find. it feels more like an ending than a phase.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
